      <div type="clause" n="77">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 77</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man mægþ gebigeð ceapi, geceapod sy gif hit unfacne is.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person buys a maiden with a [bride-]price, let the bargain be [valid], if there is no deception.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon mægþ gebigeđ, ceapi geceapod sy, gif hit unfacne is.</ab>
